  <AltText>
    Animation of the sprite of Cosmic, a fluffy fox with purple and white fur. There are also rings around her ears, which are animated to cycle through the colours of the progress pride flag.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    Tried our hand at animation again, and I think we did okay with this one.
    Actually animated the ear rings to cycle through the colours of the progress (pride) flag!
  </Description>
